WEBVTT

00:00:01.910 --> 00:00:03.800
I'm Hoshizora Miyuki!

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:07.100
I met Candy, who came out of a picture book,

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:11.870
and somehow I became a legendary warrior: a Precure.

00:00:14.510 --> 00:00:18.010
And after I defeated a monster called an “Akanbe”,

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:20.200
a Cure Décor appeared!

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:28.320
I want to you to be a Precure and collect Cure Décors,

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:31.530
and then I want you to save my world-kuru!

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:34.020
I don't really understand…

00:00:34.020 --> 00:00:35.660
…but this sounds interesting!

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:37.350
Ultra okay!

00:00:37.350 --> 00:00:38.740
Let's do this!

00:00:38.740 --> 00:00:40.840
Kuru!

00:00:43.980 --> 00:00:45.550
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:00:45.550 --> 00:00:47.380
Smile Precure!

00:00:47.690 --> 00:00:48.290
Let's go!

00:00:48.290 --> 00:00:49.820
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:00:49.820 --> 00:00:50.960
All together!

00:00:51.190 --> 00:00:52.560
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:00:52.560 --> 00:00:54.760
Jump to tomorrow!

00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:57.430
Smile Precure!

00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:02.270
Smile! Smile! Smile Precure!

00:01:02.530 --> 00:01:07.710
A smile, shining like the sun.

00:01:08.070 --> 00:01:12.910
We all carry an undying sparkle.

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:18.850
Keep going with all you've got, girls!

00:01:19.220 --> 00:01:23.790
Those beads of sweat are diamonds.

00:01:23.190 --> 00:01:23.750
So bright!

00:01:23.790 --> 00:01:28.960
The future that you'll shine the way to

00:01:29.330 --> 00:01:35.400
When you five lights seize the will to win.

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:35.900
Happy! Sunny! Peace! March! Beauty!

00:01:36.430 --> 00:01:37.070
Let's go!

00:01:37.070 --> 00:01:39.770
(Smile! Smile!) The power of a smile

00:01:39.770 --> 00:01:42.710
(Smile! Smile!) Joins us all together.

00:01:43.040 --> 00:01:47.510
We'll never let a friend cry!

00:01:46.880 --> 00:01:48.080
Girls! Let's go!

00:01:48.150 --> 00:01:49.750
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:50.880
Everybody!

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:52.550
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:52.550 --> 00:01:55.090
Fly to the future!

00:01:55.420 --> 00:01:58.590
Sparkle! Smile Precure!

00:01:59.360 --> 00:02:00.760
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:02:00.760 --> 00:02:03.060
Smile Precure!

00:02:06.910 --> 00:02:08.470
Now to do this properly.

00:02:08.870 --> 00:02:10.170
I'm Hoshizora Miyuki.

00:02:10.170 --> 00:02:11.540
I'm Candy-kuru!

00:02:11.860 --> 00:02:14.580
Pleased to meet you!

00:02:16.080 --> 00:02:17.080
What was that?

00:02:17.080 --> 00:02:20.120
That was the sound of my stomach-kuru.

00:02:20.120 --> 00:02:22.020
At times like this…

00:02:22.020 --> 00:02:24.320
…the Cure Décor really comes in handy-kuru!

00:02:24.320 --> 00:02:27.290
The Cure Décor has mysterious powers-kuru.

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:30.120
Miyuki, take out the Smile Pact-kuru.

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:31.910
The Smile Pact?

00:02:33.440 --> 00:02:34.570
You mean this?

00:02:34.570 --> 00:02:36.250
Err, what do I…?

00:02:36.250 --> 00:02:39.690
Put the Décor into the Smile Pact-kuru.

00:02:39.690 --> 00:02:41.040
I see.

00:02:42.410 --> 00:02:45.540
Let's go! Strawberry!

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:52.500
Didn't you say the Cure Décor are for saving your world?

00:02:53.110 --> 00:02:56.400
That's right-kuru. They're really precious-kuru.

00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:59.840
On top of that, the only ones who can collect them

00:02:59.840 --> 00:03:02.030
are the five Precure-kuru.

00:03:02.030 --> 00:03:04.730
The five Precure?

00:03:05.460 --> 00:03:07.430
There are other Precure?!

00:03:07.930 --> 00:03:10.570
<i>Amazing!</i>

00:03:11.950 --> 00:03:14.140
I'd be worried if it were just you.

00:03:14.140 --> 00:03:16.910
Hurry up and find the other Precure-kuru.

00:03:17.520 --> 00:03:21.070
How can you talk to me like that?

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:40.400
That Precure!

00:03:42.650 --> 00:03:44.970
How could I lose to a brat like her?

00:03:45.220 --> 00:03:46.570
Whatever.

00:03:46.570 --> 00:03:49.890
Next time our paths cross, I'll make sure I eliminate her.

00:03:57.600 --> 00:03:59.650
Right! Time to show you how it's done!

00:04:05.410 --> 00:04:06.190
She's fast!

00:04:08.290 --> 00:04:10.190
Pass it, Hoshizora-san!

00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:19.700
Nice!

00:04:19.880 --> 00:04:20.800
Block it!

00:04:20.800 --> 00:04:21.270
Yeah!

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:24.470
If you think you can block it, go ahead and try!

00:04:24.470 --> 00:04:28.340
Hino-chan Special Attack!

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:32.120
She beat us!

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:35.450
What do you expect from the candidate for the volleyball club's ace attacker?

00:04:35.630 --> 00:04:37.100
Alright!

00:04:38.870 --> 00:04:40.560
Hoshizora-san!

00:04:46.650 --> 00:04:49.090
Hey, are you still alive?

00:04:49.090 --> 00:04:50.270
Somehow.

00:04:50.270 --> 00:04:53.160
That was pretty good, that face strike!

00:04:54.260 --> 00:04:56.430
Same with your whimpering receive.

00:04:56.430 --> 00:04:58.440
I wasn't crying!

00:04:58.440 --> 00:05:02.210
The sporty Hino-san and the gentle Kise-san…

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:04.190
That's it!

00:05:04.190 --> 00:05:05.240
What's what?

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:07.350
I want you two…

00:05:08.880 --> 00:05:11.390
…to be Precure with me!

00:05:12.060 --> 00:05:13.280
Pre…

00:05:13.280 --> 00:05:14.140
…Cure?

00:05:14.140 --> 00:05:15.020
Precure!

00:05:15.020 --> 00:05:16.610
That's right! Precure!

00:05:16.610 --> 00:05:19.330
Let's do it! Come on! Come on! <i>Please!</i>

00:05:17.890 --> 00:05:20.560
Wh-What the heck? What's a “Precure”?

00:05:19.320 --> 00:05:21.730
We'll have so much fun doing it together!

00:05:31.390 --> 00:05:33.710
Precure are a secret-kuru!

00:05:33.710 --> 00:05:34.910
Why?

00:05:34.910 --> 00:05:38.080
Besides, it's not like just <i>anybody</i> can become a Precure-kuru!

00:05:39.240 --> 00:05:41.080
So, what kind of person <i>can?</i>

00:05:41.690 --> 00:05:42.450
Well…

00:05:42.770 --> 00:05:43.450
Well?

00:05:43.720 --> 00:05:44.350
<i>Well…</i>

00:05:44.690 --> 00:05:45.250
Well?

00:05:47.050 --> 00:05:48.270
I don't know-kuru!

00:05:49.180 --> 00:05:51.260
You don't know?!

00:05:51.260 --> 00:05:54.970
But apparently a klutzy airhead like <i>me</i> can become one.

00:05:54.970 --> 00:05:56.630
That's true-kuru.

00:05:56.630 --> 00:06:00.190
Hey, you're not supposed to agree!

00:06:02.770 --> 00:06:03.540
Hino-san?!

00:06:03.980 --> 00:06:06.880
You just hid a sheep plushie, didn't you?

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:08.050
Sheep?!

00:06:08.050 --> 00:06:09.880
I'm not a sheep!

00:06:09.880 --> 00:06:11.040
What was that?

00:06:11.040 --> 00:06:12.530
Hmm? Hmm? <i>Hmm?</i>

00:06:12.530 --> 00:06:14.950
N-Nothing at all!

00:06:14.950 --> 00:06:16.880
Oh, never mind.

00:06:16.880 --> 00:06:19.740
Oh, yeah, about that Crepure thing.

00:06:19.740 --> 00:06:21.190
I'll pass.

00:06:21.370 --> 00:06:23.960
The volleyball club is giving me enough to think about right now.

00:06:23.960 --> 00:06:26.800
I've got to become their ace attacker!

00:06:27.420 --> 00:06:29.490
No worries! No worries!

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:32.350
Besides, being the ace attacker would be pretty impressive!

00:06:32.350 --> 00:06:35.700
Oh? Want to come see me in my full glory?

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:37.760
Can I? I want to go!

00:06:42.190 --> 00:06:43.780
Go for it, Hino-san!

00:06:49.830 --> 00:06:50.930
Huh?

00:06:51.330 --> 00:06:53.260
Is Hino-san the current ace?

00:06:53.590 --> 00:06:55.220
Hmm, <i>is</i> she now…?

00:06:55.720 --> 00:06:57.930
I reckon Yuka's the ace.

00:06:58.130 --> 00:06:59.260
Nice, Yuka!

00:07:15.220 --> 00:07:16.370
Hino-san…

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:18.720
She looked really frustrated…

00:07:23.320 --> 00:07:24.220
Hino-san?

00:07:38.120 --> 00:07:39.530
She's crying!

00:07:41.420 --> 00:07:42.640
This is where I come in!

00:07:42.870 --> 00:07:46.110
Hey, Hino-san!

00:07:47.810 --> 00:07:49.510
Hoshizora-san!

00:07:51.570 --> 00:07:53.480
Hey, are you alright?

00:07:53.630 --> 00:07:55.450
I'm fine!

00:07:55.450 --> 00:07:56.640
Never mind me, Hino-san.

00:07:56.640 --> 00:07:57.950
Cheer up!

00:07:58.530 --> 00:08:01.070
When you cry, your happiness disappears!

00:08:01.070 --> 00:08:02.660
Smile! Smile!

00:08:04.730 --> 00:08:07.210
But… I wasn't crying…

00:08:07.640 --> 00:08:10.810
But I just saw teardrops on the ground!

00:08:10.810 --> 00:08:11.900
That was sweat!

00:08:11.900 --> 00:08:12.570
Sweat?

00:08:12.940 --> 00:08:14.320
Silly me!

00:08:14.320 --> 00:08:16.910
I could have sworn you were feeling down about that match!

00:08:17.080 --> 00:08:19.430
I wasn't feeling down!

00:08:19.430 --> 00:08:22.240
Some extra training is all I need!

00:08:22.240 --> 00:08:24.580
In that case, I'll help you out!

00:08:24.580 --> 00:08:26.470
I don't need anyone's help!

00:08:26.470 --> 00:08:28.580
At least, that's what I'd normally say.

00:08:31.450 --> 00:08:32.790
I guess I'll take up the offer!

00:08:32.800 --> 00:08:34.160
Okay!

00:08:34.760 --> 00:08:37.920
Not there! <i>Higher!</i>

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:37.920
Yes!

00:08:38.650 --> 00:08:40.030
Harder!

00:08:39.310 --> 00:08:43.220
That Miyuki… She's forgotten about looking for Precure-kuru.

00:08:40.300 --> 00:08:41.860
Another one!

00:08:41.860 --> 00:08:42.500
Yes!

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:43.700
Again!

00:08:53.310 --> 00:08:55.450
As the sun sinks under the horizon,

00:08:55.450 --> 00:08:59.680
a pitch-black Bad End follows shortly after.

00:09:06.120 --> 00:09:07.320
Sunny!

00:09:13.270 --> 00:09:14.460
Candy!

00:09:19.110 --> 00:09:20.610
Hino-san!

00:09:20.610 --> 00:09:21.840
Do your best!

00:09:38.020 --> 00:09:38.750
Alright!

00:09:40.720 --> 00:09:42.590
That's great, Hino-san!

00:09:43.760 --> 00:09:45.360
Those humans.

00:09:45.360 --> 00:09:47.930
The stronger their dreams burn with hope,

00:09:47.930 --> 00:09:51.960
the more Bad Energy is released when they are crushed.

00:09:52.600 --> 00:09:54.110
The world!

00:09:54.110 --> 00:09:58.290
Be stained with the worst possible ending: a Bad End!

00:09:58.940 --> 00:10:02.300
I'll blot out the pages where your future will be written!

00:10:07.700 --> 00:10:09.590
This is the worst possible ending.

00:10:10.050 --> 00:10:12.420
I've lost all my hopes and dreams.

00:10:13.110 --> 00:10:13.940
What?

00:10:13.940 --> 00:10:18.320
Wolfrun is trying to give the world a Bad End-kuru!

00:10:18.320 --> 00:10:20.400
You mean, like before?

00:10:22.290 --> 00:10:24.900
The Bad Energy from these humans

00:10:24.900 --> 00:10:27.470
is bringing back Pierrot-sama,

00:10:27.470 --> 00:10:29.870
the Emperor of Evil!

00:10:34.020 --> 00:10:36.650
Miyuki! Turn into a Precure and fight-kuru!

00:10:39.190 --> 00:10:42.820
There's nothing so delightful as seeing the face of a human in despair.

00:10:42.820 --> 00:10:45.520
Look at that face of despair!

00:10:46.700 --> 00:10:50.060
She's a fool who works so hard when it's all futile.

00:10:54.710 --> 00:10:56.550
It's not futile!

00:10:56.550 --> 00:10:59.240
How can you make fun of Hino-san,

00:10:59.240 --> 00:11:02.320
my <i>friend,</i> who's working so hard toward her dream?

00:11:02.320 --> 00:11:04.210
I won't let you get away with this!

00:11:04.510 --> 00:11:06.070
Miyuki!

00:11:06.070 --> 00:11:07.460
That's the spirit-kuru!

00:11:07.460 --> 00:11:09.180
Transform into a Precure!

00:11:09.180 --> 00:11:10.250
Yeah!

00:11:13.780 --> 00:11:15.080
Ready?

00:11:15.820 --> 00:11:18.470
Precure Smile Charge!

00:11:18.470 --> 00:11:19.460
Go!

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:21.750
Go! Go!

00:11:22.350 --> 00:11:24.320
Let's go, Happy!

00:11:47.450 --> 00:11:49.450
The light of the future,

00:11:49.450 --> 00:11:50.920
shining bright!

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:53.920
Cure Happy!

00:11:56.450 --> 00:11:58.940
You show yourself again, Precure.

00:11:58.940 --> 00:12:01.500
Come out, Akanbe!

00:12:05.010 --> 00:12:06.800
Akanbe!

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:10.110
Akanbe!

00:12:10.350 --> 00:12:12.190
Actually, this <i>is</i> a bit scary…

00:12:12.190 --> 00:12:13.440
Do your best-kuru!

00:12:13.800 --> 00:12:16.680
Give everyone back their smiles of hope-kuru!

00:12:17.190 --> 00:12:19.020
Smiles of hope?

00:12:20.110 --> 00:12:21.660
I'm scared, but I'll do my best!

00:12:21.660 --> 00:12:24.550
<i>Akanbe!</i>

00:12:26.980 --> 00:12:30.180
I can't! I can't! I just <i>can't!</i>

00:12:40.780 --> 00:12:42.510
Akanbe!

00:12:46.210 --> 00:12:47.440
What a kick!

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:49.980
Cleanse it with the Happy Shower-kuru!

00:12:49.980 --> 00:12:51.080
Yeah!

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:52.930
Wait, how do I do that again?

00:12:52.930 --> 00:12:54.810
Use the Smile Pact-kuru!

00:12:54.810 --> 00:12:56.050
That's right!

00:12:57.320 --> 00:12:58.650
<i>Spirit!</i>

00:12:59.470 --> 00:13:01.260
<i>Spirit!</i>

00:13:04.270 --> 00:13:05.810
Precure!

00:13:07.500 --> 00:13:09.280
Happy…

00:13:09.280 --> 00:13:10.980
…Shower!

00:13:18.610 --> 00:13:19.770
<i>Akan—</i>

00:13:19.770 --> 00:13:21.410
No way!

00:13:21.410 --> 00:13:23.350
I missed!

00:13:24.210 --> 00:13:25.650
I'm exhausted!

00:13:25.650 --> 00:13:28.220
Don't give up-kuru! Do it again-kuru!

00:13:28.220 --> 00:13:29.650
Do it <i>again?</i>

00:13:29.650 --> 00:13:31.450
What choice have I got?

00:13:34.340 --> 00:13:35.800
Precure!

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:39.560
Happy…

00:13:39.560 --> 00:13:41.980
…Shower!

00:13:45.280 --> 00:13:48.900
Could it be that you can only do it once per transformation-kuru?

00:13:49.110 --> 00:13:50.810
No one told me that!

00:13:51.240 --> 00:13:52.910
<i>Akan—</i>

00:13:54.640 --> 00:13:55.240
<i>—be!</i>

00:13:59.930 --> 00:14:02.220
Is that all you've got?

00:14:02.220 --> 00:14:05.160
It's a just a matter of time until you burst into tears!

00:14:05.160 --> 00:14:07.410
This isn't enough to make me cry!

00:14:07.410 --> 00:14:09.150
My happiness would disappear!

00:14:09.150 --> 00:14:10.530
Smile! Smile!

00:14:12.900 --> 00:14:13.990
Smile…

00:14:14.760 --> 00:14:17.150
<i>When you cry, your happiness disappears!</i>

00:14:17.150 --> 00:14:19.220
<i>Smile! Smile!</i>

00:14:22.680 --> 00:14:23.910
Hoshizora-san?!

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:27.380
What's going on?

00:14:29.280 --> 00:14:31.890
What's that giant volleyball?

00:14:31.890 --> 00:14:33.950
Wait, is that <i>you,</i> Hoshizora-san?

00:14:33.950 --> 00:14:35.390
Y-Yes!

00:14:35.400 --> 00:14:37.990
Oh, I've shouldn't have answered! This is supposed to be secret!

00:14:37.990 --> 00:14:40.860
What, you mean that <i>is</i> you?

00:14:40.860 --> 00:14:42.690
Wait, what's that monster?

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:44.420
Never mind! Run away!

00:14:44.420 --> 00:14:46.060
Who do we have here?

00:14:46.360 --> 00:14:48.530
This makes no sense!

00:14:50.400 --> 00:14:52.470
Run, Hino-san!

00:14:52.470 --> 00:14:53.470
Hoshizora-san!

00:14:53.720 --> 00:14:56.780
You said she's your friend, didn't you?

00:14:57.330 --> 00:14:58.540
Pathetic!

00:14:58.940 --> 00:15:01.340
“Friends” and “hard work”.

00:15:01.340 --> 00:15:05.280
There's no need for any of that in the world of Bad End.

00:15:05.280 --> 00:15:07.520
Don't call friendship pathetic!

00:15:08.620 --> 00:15:09.940
In fun times…

00:15:09.940 --> 00:15:11.290
…in happy times…

00:15:11.290 --> 00:15:14.690
…things are so much better with friends!

00:15:14.690 --> 00:15:17.690
They're there for you when times are tough.

00:15:18.000 --> 00:15:20.030
Friendship really matters!

00:15:29.550 --> 00:15:35.540
So, basically, you're just a wimp who can't do anything without your friends to help you.

00:15:35.540 --> 00:15:37.080
Finish her, Akanbe!

00:15:40.130 --> 00:15:41.020
<i>Akan—</i>

00:15:44.530 --> 00:15:46.020
What are you trying to do?

00:15:46.810 --> 00:15:48.750
What do you think you're doing

00:15:48.750 --> 00:15:50.860
to my friend?!

00:15:51.040 --> 00:15:52.290
Hino-san, stay away!

00:15:55.310 --> 00:15:56.800
Hoshizora-san…

00:15:56.800 --> 00:16:00.070
…has always cheered me on!

00:16:00.070 --> 00:16:02.910
Now it's my time to help <i>her!</i>

00:16:03.240 --> 00:16:06.240
What's the point in saving a weakling like her?

00:16:06.550 --> 00:16:08.210
“Weakling”?!

00:16:08.210 --> 00:16:11.210
Are you making fun of my friend?

00:16:11.210 --> 00:16:13.220
I won't let you get away with this!

00:16:13.220 --> 00:16:14.250
Aka—

00:16:14.260 --> 00:16:15.020
Hino-san!

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:18.590
You really believe a human can beat an Akanbe?

00:16:18.820 --> 00:16:20.230
You think…

00:16:20.230 --> 00:16:22.380
…that matters?

00:16:25.330 --> 00:16:26.030
What?

00:16:27.760 --> 00:16:28.700
Is that…?

00:16:35.470 --> 00:16:36.570
What's this?

00:16:36.570 --> 00:16:37.990
Kuru!

00:16:38.740 --> 00:16:41.480
You're the second Precure-kuru!

00:16:42.450 --> 00:16:44.180
The plushie talked!

00:16:44.380 --> 00:16:46.830
Wait, what? “Curepre”?

00:16:46.830 --> 00:16:48.780
Like what Hoshizora-san was talking about?

00:16:48.780 --> 00:16:53.290
<i>Precure</i> are legendary warriors who defend the world from evil-kuru!

00:16:53.290 --> 00:16:54.760
“Legendary warriors-kuru”?

00:16:55.000 --> 00:16:55.960
Now,

00:16:55.960 --> 00:16:57.360
transform-kuru!

00:16:57.830 --> 00:16:58.750
Transform?!

00:16:58.750 --> 00:17:01.560
Put the Smile Pact together with a Cure Décor,

00:17:01.560 --> 00:17:04.430
and cry “Precure Smile Charge!”-kuru!

00:17:05.010 --> 00:17:07.330
I don't really understand…

00:17:07.330 --> 00:17:08.640
…but I'll give it a shot!

00:17:12.350 --> 00:17:13.650
Ready?

00:17:14.330 --> 00:17:16.890
Precure Smile Charge!

00:17:16.890 --> 00:17:18.180
Go!

00:17:18.880 --> 00:17:20.180
Go! Go!

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:22.550
Let's go, Sunny!

00:17:46.460 --> 00:17:48.410
Dazzling sun!

00:17:48.410 --> 00:17:50.320
Hot-blooded power!

00:17:50.990 --> 00:17:52.760
Cure Sunny!

00:18:01.620 --> 00:18:03.960
Amazing! You transformed!

00:18:01.620 --> 00:18:03.960
I did it! I found a Precure-kuru!

00:18:04.160 --> 00:18:05.200
What?

00:18:05.200 --> 00:18:07.030
She can transform, too?

00:18:07.360 --> 00:18:08.440
Transform?

00:18:09.470 --> 00:18:12.300
What's this? I really transformed!

00:18:12.300 --> 00:18:13.470
But wait…

00:18:13.470 --> 00:18:15.700
“Dazzling sun! Cure Sunny!”

00:18:15.700 --> 00:18:17.680
That's totally embarrassing!

00:18:17.680 --> 00:18:19.480
Hino-san!

00:18:19.740 --> 00:18:21.030
Hoshizora-san?

00:18:21.030 --> 00:18:23.520
Cure Sunny is <i>so</i> cool!

00:18:23.520 --> 00:18:27.820
“Dazzling sun” suits a passionate girl like you perfectly!

00:18:28.450 --> 00:18:29.020
For real?

00:18:30.150 --> 00:18:31.310
I guess you're right.

00:18:31.310 --> 00:18:36.970
The sun fits a super hero like me perfectly!

00:18:36.970 --> 00:18:38.890
What are you two on about?

00:18:42.030 --> 00:18:43.330
What the heck's that wolf?

00:18:43.700 --> 00:18:47.670
It's a Big Bad Wolf trying to give the world a Bad End-kuru!

00:18:47.820 --> 00:18:49.370
Big Bad Wolf?

00:18:49.370 --> 00:18:52.010
Enough of the “Big Bad Wolf”.

00:18:52.010 --> 00:18:53.700
Go, Akanbe!

00:18:53.700 --> 00:18:55.180
Akanbe!

00:18:56.340 --> 00:18:58.080
Akan—

00:18:59.240 --> 00:19:02.820
<i>Aka—</i>

00:19:02.820 --> 00:19:05.650
<i>—nbe!</i>

00:19:07.460 --> 00:19:08.860
No pity!

00:19:12.770 --> 00:19:13.860
Huh?

00:19:14.690 --> 00:19:15.700
Hino-san?

00:19:15.700 --> 00:19:17.400
I don't know how,

00:19:17.400 --> 00:19:18.900
but I'm holding it back!

00:19:19.770 --> 00:19:21.300
Akanbe! Akanb—

00:19:21.690 --> 00:19:23.040
What are you

00:19:23.040 --> 00:19:25.940
going “Akanbe” about?

00:19:29.580 --> 00:19:30.980
Akanbe!

00:19:35.280 --> 00:19:36.320
What?!

00:19:36.710 --> 00:19:38.190
Sunny! That's amazing!

00:19:38.190 --> 00:19:40.530
A Precure's power is… pretty amazing…

00:19:40.530 --> 00:19:43.210
Cleanse it with the Sunny Fire-kuru!

00:19:43.210 --> 00:19:44.660
What's <i>that?</i>

00:19:44.660 --> 00:19:47.370
Put your spirit into the Smile Pact-kuru!

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:49.120
I don't really understand…

00:19:49.600 --> 00:19:50.400
…but I'll do it!

00:19:54.400 --> 00:19:56.940
Huh? It's sucking up power!

00:19:56.940 --> 00:19:59.580
Sunny! Keep going! Keep going!

00:19:59.930 --> 00:20:02.220
I don't get it, but alright!

00:20:02.220 --> 00:20:03.680
Akanbe!

00:20:08.850 --> 00:20:10.820
I just… shot a fireball!

00:20:10.820 --> 00:20:12.660
How did I do that?!

00:20:13.690 --> 00:20:16.130
Remember that extra training we did together!

00:20:18.030 --> 00:20:19.600
Oh, right!

00:20:20.060 --> 00:20:21.830
Precure!

00:20:23.520 --> 00:20:25.990
Sunny Fire!

00:20:32.640 --> 00:20:34.930
Akanbe!

00:20:42.290 --> 00:20:44.960
What the…? I'm totally worn out…

00:20:44.960 --> 00:20:46.160
Sunny!

00:20:46.890 --> 00:20:50.500
I'm so glad you've become a Precure!

00:20:50.500 --> 00:20:52.840
I still don't have a clue what's going on!

00:20:54.920 --> 00:20:55.830
What's this?

00:20:55.830 --> 00:20:57.900
A Cure Décor-kuru!

00:20:57.900 --> 00:21:01.100
Those Precure! They just keep on coming!

00:21:01.100 --> 00:21:02.770
I'll beat you <i>next time!</i>

00:21:13.340 --> 00:21:15.750
I'm so glad everyone's back to normal!

00:21:16.350 --> 00:21:17.790
And what about this…?

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:19.400
It's a Cure Décor-kuru!

00:21:19.400 --> 00:21:23.090
I want you to collect them and save my world-kuru!

00:21:23.730 --> 00:21:25.560
I don't really get it…

00:21:25.580 --> 00:21:27.060
…but I'll give it a shot!

00:21:27.290 --> 00:21:30.180
Even if you're a little lost sheep, I can't just leave you alone!

00:21:30.180 --> 00:21:31.870
I'm no sheep!

00:21:31.870 --> 00:21:32.640
I'm with you!

00:21:33.010 --> 00:21:35.510
Being a Precure with you, Hino-san,

00:21:35.510 --> 00:21:37.210
makes me ultra happy!

00:21:37.430 --> 00:21:39.140
Just call me Akane!

00:21:39.140 --> 00:21:40.250
We're…

00:21:40.250 --> 00:21:41.910
…friends, right?

00:21:46.080 --> 00:21:48.320
Let's stick together, Miyuki!

00:21:50.070 --> 00:21:51.130
Yeah!

00:21:51.130 --> 00:21:52.890
Let's stick together, Akane-chan!

00:21:57.160 --> 00:21:59.300
Maybe it's the kids who care about their friends

00:21:59.660 --> 00:22:03.900
who are the ones who can become Precure-kuru!

00:23:44.230 --> 00:23:47.070
Miyuki, it's time to look for the third Precure-kuru!

00:23:47.070 --> 00:23:49.610
Alright, the next Precure would be…

00:23:49.610 --> 00:23:52.010
Hey, Kise-san is really good at drawing, isn't she?

00:23:52.010 --> 00:23:54.710
You think? I love heroes from comic books!

00:23:54.710 --> 00:23:56.110
So, why not be a Precure?

00:23:56.110 --> 00:23:58.410
They're super heroes who protect the world!

00:23:58.410 --> 00:23:59.220
What's that?

00:23:59.220 --> 00:24:01.580
I'm not sure I understand, but it sounds like fun!

00:24:02.010 --> 00:24:03.550
Smile Precure!

00:24:06.550 --> 00:24:08.970
Find your ultra happy smile!
